  "body": "The second read of PR #2890 (merged as `9a4cf16f9`) found no blocker. These items stay open:\n\n- [ ] `crates/app/src/operation/rest_op.rs:75`: the refusal for a suppressed earlier operation says \"or use the entered previous tool\". A 2D Adaptive refuses the entered tool, so the advice is wrong for it.\n- [ ] With the rest group on, a selected Helix or Ramp entry is ignored and no path note says so. (The pass start has a note.)\n- [ ] The row in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` does not list `REST_ADAPTIVE_CORNER_RELIEF`.\n- [ ] The film of material that the plan drops (thinner than one grid cell band) shows only in the path note. Show it in the operation status too.\n- [ ] `crates/app/tests/rest_adaptive_op.rs` has 442 lines. Split it under 400.\n- [ ] No test of the 2D Adaptive pins \"a suppressed earlier operation\" and \"this operation becomes stale when an earlier operation changes\". The generic suites cover them.\n\nRefs #1446.\n",
